  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/05/IMG_1814.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(47 fotos) Este viernes ha reabierto el pub de Tales, en la avenida del Mont&iacute;, 20, esta vez con el nombre de Nachela&#39;s, despu&eacute;s de llamarse Pakopes o Troncs. Hasta que acabe el curso abrir&aacute; de viernes a domingo de 16 a 24 horas. En &eacute;poca estival el horario ser&aacute; de 20 horas al cierre, todos los d&iacute;as.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugnachelaspubtales/img_1744.jpg\" alt=\"img_1744\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugnachelaspubtales/img_1745.jpg\" alt=\"img_1745\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugnachelaspubtales/img_1746.jpg\" alt=\"img_1746\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugnachelaspubtales/img_1747.jpg\" alt=\"img_1747\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugnachelaspubtales/img_1749.jpg\" alt=\"img_1749\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugnachelaspubtales/img_1751.jpg\" alt=\"img_1751\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugnachelaspubtales/img_1753.jpg\" alt=\"img_1753\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugnachelaspubtales/img_1755.jpg\" alt=\"img_1755\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugnachelaspubtales/img_1756.jpg\" alt=\"img_1756\" style=\"max-width:100%;he